Package: ooseccomp
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: SYSCALL FILTER
 Applies BPF seccomp filters restricting dangerous syscalls like ptrace and unshare.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
